          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#RelationToFormalNeighbourhoodOfTheDiagonal Relation to the formal neighbourhood of the diagonal
          %p
            In the standard models of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+cohesion"} differential cohesion
            (such as for
            = succeed ")," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+smooth+infinity-groupoids"} formal smooth infinity-groupoids
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
